{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は金沢ガールズフェスティバルでしたっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん！本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６の事をどれくらい知って頂いてるのかな？\nと最初は不安でしたが、スクリーンに乃木坂４６と言う文字が映ったときに会場からわー!!という声が聴こえてきて、めちゃくちゃ嬉しかったです!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度行ったときはもっと曲やりたいなと思いました！\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近沢山のイベントでライヴをさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回反省点もでて、次に繋げる課題などもでて、一気にぎゅぎゅっと学んだ感じがします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あげていかないとダメだな\nこのままじゃダメなんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは自分で見つけられた所もあるけど、乃木坂ふぁむの皆さんや、スタッフさん、色んな方が教えて下さいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。\nレベルあげられるのは自分しかいないから厳しくいかないとなっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもっ\nこの期間はガチで楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねっ個人的にこんなに幸せでよいのかって思った事も多々ありますっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヌルフフフ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい。\n幸せって思えることに感謝です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてっ\n遅くなっちゃったけどまいまいお誕生日おめでとうございますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後のひなぴょんさんが言うように聖母さんで、まいまいからはいつも優しいを頂いております!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも乃木坂の優しい聖母さんとしてよろしくお願いいたします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/03/31/5603824/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃっ!!\n握手会でねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}